<title>MALAYSIA: Hospital Pantai shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Hospital Pantai shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Malaysian private hospital operator Hospital Pantai Bhd were suspended from trading on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on Monday at the company's request, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>Company officials could not be reached for comment.</p>
<p>The statement said the suspension was pending an announcement.</p>
<p>Hospital Pantai shares were last traded at 22.80 ringgit, two ringgit up from its close last Friday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
